{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-22T08:12:53.167Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3bd399253f749384107e3b9f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-22T08:12:53.167Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Root cause: pm 2026.9.18 (pm-g8oh0f) omits the read_output receipt from a complete uncompacted read and attaches it only when the output-budget compaction path engaged, so captureRealListAllEnvelope's unconditional read_output.legacy_aliases_used assertion threw TypeError under pm 2026.9.21. Fix: the generator's completeness gate now treats an absent read_output as exactly 'no compaction receipt' and stays fail-closed through independent envelope signals, extended with a non-null next_cursor continuation and a present output_budget_truncation disclosure; src/generator.ts docstrings document both envelope shapes (pm <=2026.9.17 always emits read_output, >=2026.9.18 omits it when uncompacted)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-22T08:12:53.167Z"}],"before_hash":"94950e44aa97b3e2212b562e1227cf0951521f4a99e8bca6dd7d1435e02b86ba","after_hash":"8999d337d682c16dc018e21e3ceeac44becb8aae82bcd65a1ffd4ed667653493","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"01682d20933943aed7bc47250c458c6b1ecfafef99ae9f6aa3067cd67464b0c1"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-22T08:12:54.077Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3bd399253f749384107e3b9f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-22T08:12:54.077Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Adversarial tests (test/generator.test.ts): the refusal suite still mutates the real 2026.9.21 envelope, which carries no read_output, proving a truncated envelope WITHOUT a receipt is still refused (IncompleteListAllError, truncated=true); a new capture of a real budget-compacted read (read_output present, output_budget_truncation.reason=output_budget_reached) is refused naming truncated=true, has_more=true, next_cursor= and the budget disclosure; a new test proves a legacy always-attached read_output receipt still flows through unchanged; next_cursor and output_budget_truncation each refuse independently, including a disclosure whose reason is missing."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-22T08:12:54.077Z"}],"before_hash":"8999d337d682c16dc018e21e3ceeac44becb8aae82bcd65a1ffd4ed667653493","after_hash":"218dfe4b741247c35a3173fbaf328600deb50589e5a072fac5cd2a42132c8b77","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fdeafcf87ffe50a551d1771c411497d57aad037ef4837cb789fe0f6bfb0dc9d9"}
