{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-22T08:13:00.639Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3bd399253f749384107e3b9f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-22T08:13:00.639Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Functional proof (scratch workspace, pm 2026.9.21): `pm init` in an empty dir, then three items created with pm 2026.9.21 (pm-2n22 open \"Add weekly digest email\"; pm-zet5 closed \"Fix digest timezone handling\"; pm-1px2 closed \"Write digest delivery runbook\"). The real complete `pm list --all --json` read (count=3 total=3, truncated=false, has_more=false) carries NO read_output, and the built pm-changelog consumed it without refusal and generated:\n\n```markdown\n# Changelog\n\n## Unreleased\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fix digest timezone handling ([pm-zet5](https://example.com/blob/main/.agents/pm/tasks/pm-zet5.toon))\n\n### Other\n\n- Write digest delivery runbook ([pm-1px2](https://example.com/blob/main/.agents/pm/tasks/pm-1px2.toon))\n```\n\nThe open item pm-2n22 is correctly excluded."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-22T08:13:00.639Z"}],"before_hash":"a9f61b372c2f08a8bc98c11a3a54ce14d6e3e6ceed3f60385a79374f5268b754","after_hash":"31d14670968de23ee2c0cf0bf00e81cd7cf9ba28f4da6321d0c51378b08cc1d0","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c4e0a03a4d3407e4371fc8660e03f089b5e6dafcfb22526d727273291e5fdff0"}
